content.text:
Now studio.js. I'll write in parts? write tool whole file. Need to be careful. Let's draft mentally then produce.

Let me define constants:
```js
const STORAGE_KEY='prisma3d.project.v1';
const HISTORY_LIMIT=30;
const TYPE_LABEL={...};
const TRACKS_BY_KIND...
const BG_PRESETS=['#060913','#0b0710','#10131a','#050505','#1b2330'];
```

Helpers:
- `qs`, `esc`, `fmtNum`, `fmtDeg`, `hex`, `slugify`, `downloadBlob`, `bufferToBase64`, `normalizeProject`, `defaultSelection`, `formatTimecode`, `formatSeconds`.
- `isTypingTarget`.

normalizeProject defined outside class.

Need imports from model: `PROJECT_VERSION, EASE_OPTIONS, EASINGS? only EASE_OPTIONS, TRACK_META, PRIMITIVE_DEFS, PRESET_DEFS, ... createTemplate, createPrimitive, createGroup, createLight, createCamera, baseProject, defaultMaterial, createTransform, emptyKeyframes, uid, uniqueName, clamp, roundTime, sampleTrack, keyframeAt, upsertKeyframe, removeKeyframe, sortKeys, applyPreset as applyPresetToObject, objectIsAnimated, trackHasKeys, isDescendant, descendantIds, cloneObjectTree`.

Also `typeIcon, primitiveIcon, presetIcon, icon`.

Track value helper:
```js
function trackValue(obj, track) {
 if (track==='target') return [...(obj.target||[0,0,0])];
 return [...obj.transform[track]];
}
```

`tracksFor(obj)`:
- camera: position,target
- light: position
- else position,rotation,scale

Type color:
```js
nodeColor(obj) { mesh material.color; light '#fbbf24'; camera '#fb7185'; group '#a78bfa'; imported '#34d399'; }
```

Class constructor refs cache.

```js
constructor() {
 this.refs = {};
 this.project=null;
 this.engine=null;
 this.selectedId=null;
 this.selectedKey=null;
 this.time=0;
 this.playing=false;
 this.speed=1;
 this.autoKey=false;
 this.zoom=1;
 this.history=[];
 this.historyIndex=-1;
 this.restoring=false;
 this.recording=null;
 this.recordingActive=false;
 this.restoreToken=0;
 this.saveTimer=null;
 this.toastTimer=null;
 this.lastFrame=0;
 this.fpsSamples...
 this.collapsed=new Set();
 this.search='';
 this.initialized=false;
}
```

`cacheRefs()` gather 60 ids manually. Could use helper:
```js
const ids={...};
for each this.refs[k]=document.getElementById(id)
```
Time-consuming but necessary. Include:
projectName, saveState, undoBtn, redoBtn, newBtn, openBtn, saveBtn, exportBtn, exportCaret, exportMenu, helpBtn, mobileSceneBtn, mobilePropsBtn,
scenePanel, propsPanel, panelSceneClose, panelPropsClose, drawerBackdrop, objectCount, objectSearch, sceneTree, addBtn, addMenu, shapeGrid, importBtn, presetGrid, viewport, dropOverlay, recordHud, recordTime, stopRecordBtn, loadingOverlay, modeTranslate, modeRotate, modeScale, spaceBtn, spaceLabel, gridBtn, focusBtn, liveCamBtn, hintText, fpsStat, triStat,
inspector, selectionBadge,
timeline, jumpStartBtn, prevFrameBtn, playBtn, nextFrameBtn, jumpEndBtn, timeReadout, durationReadout, loopBtn, autokeyBtn, speedSelect, addKeyBtn, easeSelect, deleteKeyBtn, zoomOutBtn, zoomInBtn, zoomLabel, durationInput, fpsSelect, gridToggle, shadowToggle, timelineTip, trackObjectName, trackLabels, timelineScroll, timelineInner, ruler, trackRows, playhead, trackEmpty, toasts, modalRoot, projectFileInput, modelFileInput.

`setupStaticIcons()`.

Event binding.

Since methods many, write file.

Careful with `this` in event handlers; use arrow functions.

`start()`:
```js
async start() {
 this.cacheRefs();
 this.setupStaticIcons();
 this.renderShapeGrid();
 this.renderPresetGrid();
 const fresh = await this.loadInitialProject();
 this.bindEvents();
 try { this.engine = new Engine(...) } catch(err){ this.showFatal(err); return; }
 this.engine.setSelection(null);
 await this.engine.build(this.project,{selectedId:this.selectedId,time:this.time});
 this.engine.applyEditorCamera(this.project.camera,true);
 if (this.selectedId) this.engine.setSelection(this.selectedId);
 this.resetHistory();
 this.renderAll();
 this.updatePlayheadDom();
 this.engine.render();
 this.engine.renderer.domElement.addEventListener? no
 this.requestLoop();
 setTimeout(()=>this.refs.loadingOverlay.classList.add('is-hidden'), 260);
 this.initialized=true;
}
```
loadInitialProject:
```js
let raw=null;
try { const saved=localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY); if(saved) raw=JSON.parse(saved); } catch {}
let fresh=false;
if(raw && raw.objects) { try project=normalizeProject(raw); } catch {project=null;}
if(!project){ project=createTemplate('neon'); fresh=true; }
this.selectedId = defaultSelection(project)?.id || null;
this.time = fresh?0.85:0;
this.setSaveState(fresh?'Novo projeto':'Salvo localmente','');
```
Need setSaveState after refs. Good.
If restored, maybe toast later? skip.
- Also `this.refreshRange` no.

`requestLoop` as described.

Engine callbacks:
```js
onSelect:(id)=>this.select(id),
onTransform:()=>this.handleTransform(),
onTransformCommit:()=>this.handleTransformCommit(),
onAssetError:(m,err)=>this.toast(`Não foi possível carregar ${m.name}.`,'error')
```

Loop:
```js
this._loop = (now)=>{
 const dt = this.lastFrame ? Math.min((now-this.lastFrame)/1000,0.1):0;
 this.lastFrame=now;
 if (this.playing) this.advance(dt);
 this.engine.update(dt);
 this.engine.render();
 this.updateLiveStats(dt);
 this.updatePlayheadDom();
 requestAnimationFrame(this._loop);
};
requestAnimationFrame(this._loop);
```
`updatePlayheadDom` every frame sets style; fine. Also updates selected key? no.
- `syncInspectorTransform` while playing throttled: track this.lastInspectorSync; if playing & now-last>120 -> sync.
- `recordTime` update.
- `hintText` update maybe only on state changes, not each frame.
- hide loading after 300ms.

If engine build throws (WebGL), fatal.

Bind events list. Let's detail some.

Top:
```js
undoBtn click -> this.undo()
redoBtn
newBtn -> this.openTemplates()
openBtn -> projectFileInput.click()
saveBtn -> this.saveProject()
exportBtn -> toggleExportMenu()
exportMenu click -> data-export -> handleExport
helpBtn -> showHelp()
projectName input -> project.name = value; tree? timeline? no; project name; change -> pushHistory
document click close export menu if !closest('.menu-anchor')
```
The export menu buttons with data-export. `handleExport`:
```js
const action=e.target.closest('[data-export]')?.dataset.export;
toggle false;
if action==='json' saveProject; ...
```

Mobile buttons.

